      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Barry Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to present to the market this impressive 2 bed mid terrace house located in O'Connell Street Blackpool. Ideally positioned in a well-established and highly convenient location, this property offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to put their own stamp on a home close to Cork City centre. \r\n\r\nThe residence is close to Cork City Centre is just a 10-minute walk away, while Apple’s Cork HQ is approximately a 5-minute drive. With shops, schools, public transport and other amenities all within easy reach, this is a superbly positioned property in a popular and convenient location. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
